    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p><b>Rejection Attack Bonus:</b>&nbsp;+7 </p><p>A Tremor Sensor is installed in the feet of the host. Connected to the nervous system, the Tremor Sensor detects minute vibrations in the ground, warning the host of approaching enemies. A creature with the Tremor Sensor enhancement takes no penalty to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks to notice targets that have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Total_Concealment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Concealment\">Total Concealment</a>, provided the target moved on it's last turn. </p>",
